{"id":"8bcb53a9a5bd9405","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-extension-axioms.md","title":"纯关系词汇的有限扩张公理","display":"df-extension-axioms — 纯关系词汇的有限扩张公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-extension-axioms","aliases":["29-df-extension-axioms"],"display":"df-extension-axioms — 纯关系词汇的有限扩张公理","depends_on":["[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Eq.(6.37) and its relational generalization, pp.107–108, DjVu scans 122–123","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-extension-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-extension-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extension-axioms — 纯关系词汇的有限扩张公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Eq.(6.37) and its relational generalization, pp.107–108, DjVu scans 122–123"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle\\)</span> 是有限纯关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_j\\geq1\">\\(a_j\\geq1\\)</span>；没有函数、常量或内建数值关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,x_2,\\ldots\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x_1,x_2,\\ldots\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 互异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为有限序列串接；所有公式合取与全称块均由下式递归构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\tau,\\ell}\">\\(J_{\\tau,\\ell}\\)</span> 是下式的有限指标集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}\">\\(\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}\\)</span> 是下式的严格序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\tau,\\ell}\">\\(d_{\\tau,\\ell}\\)</span> 为它的唯一递增枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_h=(j,\\bar i)\">\\(d_h=(j,\\bar i)\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\">\\(\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\)</span> 的定义使用该分量值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为唯一见证定描述。</li>\n<li>有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t_i\\rangle_{i=a}^b\">\\(\\langle t_i\\rangle_{i=a}^b\\)</span> 按整数下标递增，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b&lt;a\">\\(b&lt;a\\)</span> 时为空；有限序列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=a}^{b}\">\\(\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=a}^{b}\\)</span> 同样按该顺序串接，空串接为空序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}-1\\}\">\\(t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}-1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in J^M\">\\(d\\in J^M\\)</span> 的坐标集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,\\ldots,M\\}\">\\(\\{1,\\ldots,M\\}\\)</span>；写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_h\">\\(d_h\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(h)\">\\(d(h)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=0\">\\(M=0\\)</span> 时只有空序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\phi\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi\\land\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\bar\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\phi\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi\\land\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\bar\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar z,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\forall z\\,\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\bar z,\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar z,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\forall z\\,\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\bar z,\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dist}_m(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^{m}\\langle\\neg(x_i=x_j)\\rangle_{j=i+1}^{m}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dist}_m(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^{m}\\langle\\neg(x_i=x_j)\\rangle_{j=i+1}^{m}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\bar i)\\mid1\\leq j\\leq r,\\ \\bar i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell+1\\}^{a_j},\\ \\ell+1\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar i)\\},\\qquad M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq|J_{\\tau,\\ell}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\bar i)\\mid1\\leq j\\leq r,\\ \\bar i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell+1\\}^{a_j},\\ \\ell+1\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar i)\\},\\qquad M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq|J_{\\tau,\\ell}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(j,\\bar i)\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}(j&#39;,\\bar i&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ j&lt;j&#39;\\lor\\left(j=j&#39;\\land\\exists s\\in\\{1,\\ldots,a_j\\}\\;(i_s&lt;i&#39;_s\\land\\forall q\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s-1\\}\\;i_q=i&#39;_q)\\right),\\quad(j,\\bar i),(j&#39;,\\bar i&#39;)\\in J_{\\tau,\\ell}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(j,\\bar i)\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}(j&#39;,\\bar i&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ j&lt;j&#39;\\lor\\left(j=j&#39;\\land\\exists s\\in\\{1,\\ldots,a_j\\}\\;(i_s&lt;i&#39;_s\\land\\forall q\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s-1\\}\\;i_q=i&#39;_q)\\right),\\quad(j,\\bar i),(j&#39;,\\bar i&#39;)\\in J_{\\tau,\\ell}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in J_{\\tau,\\ell}^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{rng}(d)=J_{\\tau,\\ell}\\land\\forall h,h&#39;\\in\\{1,\\ldots,M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\}\\;(h&lt;h&#39;\\to d_h\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}d_{h&#39;})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in J_{\\tau,\\ell}^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{rng}(d)=J_{\\tau,\\ell}\\land\\forall h,h&#39;\\in\\{1,\\ldots,M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\}\\;(h&lt;h&#39;\\to d_h\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}d_{h&#39;})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq R_j(x_{i_1},\\ldots,x_{i_{a_j}}),\\quad d_{\\tau,\\ell}(h)=(j,\\bar i),\\quad1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell};\\qquad\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}:1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq R_j(x_{i_1},\\ldots,x_{i_{a_j}}),\\quad d_{\\tau,\\ell}(h)=(j,\\bar i),\\quad1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell};\\qquad\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}:1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{\\tau,\\ell,S}(h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell},&amp;\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\in S,\\\\\\neg\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell},&amp;\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\notin S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\theta_{\\tau,\\ell,S}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\lambda_{\\tau,\\ell,S}(h)\\rangle_{h=1}^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda_{\\tau,\\ell,S}(h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell},&amp;\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\in S,\\\\\\neg\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell},&amp;\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\notin S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\theta_{\\tau,\\ell,S}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\lambda_{\\tau,\\ell,S}(h)\\rangle_{h=1}^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\mid1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell},\\ \\lfloor t/2^{h-1}\\rfloor\\bmod2=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\mid1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell},\\ \\lfloor t/2^{h-1}\\rfloor\\bmod2=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}:0\\leq t&lt;2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}\\}=\\mathcal P(\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}),\\qquad|\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}|=M_{\\tau,\\ell}=\\sum_{j=1}^r\\bigl((\\ell+1)^{a_j}-\\ell^{a_j}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}:0\\leq t&lt;2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}\\}=\\mathcal P(\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}),\\qquad|\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}|=M_{\\tau,\\ell}=\\sum_{j=1}^r\\bigl((\\ell+1)^{a_j}-\\ell^{a_j}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{All}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\langle x_i\\rangle_{i=1}^{\\ell},\\operatorname{Dist}_\\ell(x_1,\\ldots,x_\\ell)\\to\\operatorname{And}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\exists x_{\\ell+1}\\left(\\operatorname{Dist}_{\\ell+1}(x_1,\\ldots,x_{\\ell+1})\\land\\theta_{\\tau,\\ell,S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}}\\right)\\right\\rangle_{t=0}^{2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}-1}\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{All}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\langle x_i\\rangle_{i=1}^{\\ell},\\operatorname{Dist}_\\ell(x_1,\\ldots,x_\\ell)\\to\\operatorname{And}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\exists x_{\\ell+1}\\left(\\operatorname{Dist}_{\\ell+1}(x_1,\\ldots,x_{\\ell+1})\\land\\theta_{\\tau,\\ell,S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}}\\right)\\right\\rangle_{t=0}^{2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}-1}\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\rangle_{\\ell=0}^{k-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\rangle_{\\ell=0}^{k-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书式 (6.37) 及其纯关系推广，印刷页 107–108，扫描页 122–123。这里明确合取长度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的所有扩张要求，避免小域或尚未放满卵石时的真空条件。每种模式都规定所有涉及新元素的关系原子，包括重复坐标和自环。所有对象均为有限语法构造，未引入无限合取。对无向简单图必须改用受对称性及无环约束的模式，不能直接使用此处所有关系独立的样本空间。</p>\n<p>本次仅固定有限合取、量词块和模式枚举的语法顺序。各原子模式、扩张要求、空词汇边界及概率引理所用的基数保持不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a_j\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,x_2,\\ldots\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar z\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vert","display":false},{"tex":"J_{\\tau,\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\tau,\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"d_h=(j,\\bar i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle t_i\\rangle_{i=a}^b","display":false},{"tex":"b<a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=a}^{b}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in J^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\{1,\\ldots,M\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d_h","display":false},{"tex":"d(h)","display":false},{"tex":"M=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\top,\\qquad\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\phi\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi\\land\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\bar\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\langle z\\rangle\\Vert\\bar z,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\forall z\\,\\operatorname{All}_\\tau(\\bar z,\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dist}_m(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^{m}\\langle\\neg(x_i=x_j)\\rangle_{j=i+1}^{m}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"J_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\{(j,\\bar i)\\mid1\\leq j\\leq r,\\ \\bar i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell+1\\}^{a_j},\\ \\ell+1\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar i)\\},\\qquad M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq|J_{\\tau,\\ell}|.","display":true},{"tex":"(j,\\bar i)\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}(j',\\bar i')\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ j<j'\\lor\\left(j=j'\\land\\exists s\\in\\{1,\\ldots,a_j\\}\\;(i_s<i'_s\\land\\forall q\\in\\{1,\\ldots,s-1\\}\\;i_q=i'_q)\\right),\\quad(j,\\bar i),(j',\\bar i')\\in J_{\\tau,\\ell}.","display":true},{"tex":"d_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\iota d\\in J_{\\tau,\\ell}^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{rng}(d)=J_{\\tau,\\ell}\\land\\forall h,h'\\in\\{1,\\ldots,M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\}\\;(h<h'\\to d_h\\prec_{\\tau,\\ell}d_{h'})\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq R_j(x_{i_1},\\ldots,x_{i_{a_j}}),\\quad d_{\\tau,\\ell}(h)=(j,\\bar i),\\quad1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell};\\qquad\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}:1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda_{\\tau,\\ell,S}(h)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell},&\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\in S,\\\\\\neg\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell},&\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\notin S,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\theta_{\\tau,\\ell,S}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\lambda_{\\tau,\\ell,S}(h)\\rangle_{h=1}^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}).","display":true},{"tex":"S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha_h^{\\tau,\\ell}\\mid1\\leq h\\leq M_{\\tau,\\ell},\\ \\lfloor t/2^{h-1}\\rfloor\\bmod2=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\{S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}:0\\leq t<2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}\\}=\\mathcal P(\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}),\\qquad|\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}|=M_{\\tau,\\ell}=\\sum_{j=1}^r\\bigl((\\ell+1)^{a_j}-\\ell^{a_j}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{All}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\langle x_i\\rangle_{i=1}^{\\ell},\\operatorname{Dist}_\\ell(x_1,\\ldots,x_\\ell)\\to\\operatorname{And}_\\tau\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\exists x_{\\ell+1}\\left(\\operatorname{Dist}_{\\ell+1}(x_1,\\ldots,x_{\\ell+1})\\land\\theta_{\\tau,\\ell,S_{\\tau,\\ell,t}}\\right)\\right\\rangle_{t=0}^{2^{M_{\\tau,\\ell}}-1}\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_\\tau(\\langle\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\rangle_{\\ell=0}^{k-1}).","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":4983,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-extension-axioms]]、[[29-lem-extension-probability]]、[[29-lem-extension-pebble]] — 扩张公理、概率界和有限变量不可区分性"},{"id":"083aeefac65087f4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}$ 取 [[29-df-extension-axioms]] 的约定；$A,B$ 为有限 $\\tau$-结构。"},{"id":"cbf2193c8d68c9be","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k},\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}$ 取 [[29-df-extension-axioms]] 的纯关系、正元数约定。"},{"id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-extension-axioms]]"}],"outgoing":["28e86a5f0243a0ae","a3fa1d78e657e6a2","3ee556c64b16809b"]}